---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import VideoEmbed from '../../components/VideoEmbed.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Pages" description="Pages" canonicalPath="/pages" currentPage="pages">
<div class="container pages-index">
  <header class="pages-intro">
    <h1 class="display-2">Pages</h1>
    <p class="lead">Many Thoughts. Few Experiences. Several Stories.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="page-entry">
      <h2>Wonderful City of Bombay</h2>
      <p class="date">Created on 9th January, 2020</p>
      <p class="lead">
        Here is a look at my first trip to Bombay. What an amazing, colourful, vibrant and heritage-rich city!
      </p>
      <VideoEmbed title="Wonderful City of Bombay" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/O5mGaIFWynw" />
  </section>
      <hr>

  <section class="page-entry">
      <h2>Love for Kerala</h2>
      <p class="date">Created on 7th August, 2019</p>
      <p class="lead">A short VLOG on my Trip to Trivandrum, Kerala with a glimpse of their authentic cuisine.</p>
      <VideoEmbed title="Love for Kerala" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/k6IeffHTDG8" />
  </section>
      <hr>

      <section class="page-entry post">
        <a href="/pages/everyday.html">
          <h2>Everyday, Forever</h2>
          <p class="date">Edited on 7th December, 2019</p>
          <p class="lead">
            How are we to get through the days that just don't feel new? How do we fight the lack of
            incentive, the lack of reason for you to live each day to the fullest?
            You can fight it - make your own joy.
          </p>
        </a>
      </section>
      <hr>

      <section class="page-entry post">
        <a href="/pages/cycling.html">
          <h2>Adventures on a Cycle</h2>
          <p class="date">Written on 18th February, 2019</p>
          <p class="lead">
            One of my favourite ways of spending my time is travelling in and out of the heart of Bangalore.
            Discovering new places, meeting new people and having a ton of fun give me
            all the more reason to sweat myself out.
          </p>
        </a>
      </section>
      <hr>

      <section class="page-entry post">
        <a href="/pages/core.html">
          <h2>The Core</h2>
          <p class="date">Updated on 17th February, 2019</p>
          <p class="lead">
            My insight into what should matter most to each and every one of us even when we are going
            through the toughest of times. Should we blindly act based on deep sentiment even though we know it might
            not be best for us?
          </p>
        </a>
      </section>

    </div>
</SiteLayout>
